<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Is WopCart really free?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes. The plugin is GPL-licensed and every feature is included. On the free plan, WopCart retains 2% of each transaction as a platform fee, collected through Stripe Connect.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What does a paid plan change?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A paid plan removes the WopCart platform fee and lets you connect your own gateway accounts. The features stay the same.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What happens if I stop paying for a plan?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Your store returns to the free plan. Features keep working, payments are routed through WopCart's Stripe Connect platform with the 2% fee, and your data stays on your site.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Do I need a key to use the plugin?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>No. A plan key is only needed for a paid plan. Without one, the plugin makes no plan-check request.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

